# iOS Codemagic backlog

When a change is **bundled client UI/JS** that the App Store binary will not pick up from Netlify/API alone, append a row to `docs/IOS_CODEMAGIC_BACKLOG.md` under **Waiting for next Codemagic build**.

Do **not** start Codemagic unless Charles explicitly asks. Prefer live API/data paths. Batch UI and build later.

API/data-only changes go under **Already live on iOS** (or need no entry).
